  ('db39daf1-2370-481f-a9fd-f97dc887a306', 'd2e3f4a5-6b7c-4d32-9f12-2a3b4c5d6e32', null, 'topic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Shop Safety, Tools, and Materials', 'A stagecraft course treats safety as a creative foundation, not a checklist at the margins. Students learn how to use tools, materials, and shops responsibly before they build, paint, hang, focus, or run anything.', 1),
