values ('d2e3f4a5-6b7c-4d32-9f12-2a3b4c5d6e32', 'stagecraft-technical-theater', 'Stagecraft / Technical Theater', 'This course introduces the tools, materials, vocabulary, safety practices, paperwork, and collaborative workflows of technical theater. Students learn how theater spaces function, how scenery and props are built and maintained, how lighting and sound systems are organized, how costumes and wardrobe operate backstage, how rigging and crew work require disciplined safety, and how technical drawings and production organization connect all departments from design through strike.');

